# U50 a: Skills view against allflame_exp_048 (no common gems: every group unmatched, all
# gems additional), the group header icons of both builds, hovering a supported active gem
# and a gem of the comparison build, wheel scrolling (the shared view scroll bar).
#! u50-import allflame_exp_048.xml
#! u50-expect-text Ethereal Knives of the Massacre (Body Armour)
screen 1920 1080 dpi 1
fixture userdir=../u46/user
frames 2
load-build "Builds/allflame_exp_001.xml"
frames 3
move 116 98
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 504 138
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 345 632
frames 2
move 765 600
frames 2
wheel down 3
frames 2
move 345 500
frames 2
wheel up 1
frames 2
